mary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n### Reproducible in:\nv4.8.dev4.official [b56a91878]\n\n### Not reproducible in:\nv4.8.dev3.official [51105ccbe]\nv4.7.2.stable.official [ed1daf0bf]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev4 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors (853x683 @ 60.02 Hz, 1920x1080 @ 60.00 Hz) - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - GeForce GTX 550 Ti - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-2100 CPU @ 3.10GHz (4 threads) - 11.95 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIn Find in Files panel, switching tabs shows:\n>  ERROR: scene/gui/tree.cpp:367 - Index p_column = 1 is out of bounds (cells.size() = 1).\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- open project: [find_in_files_tab_switch_error.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31860435/find_in_files_tab_switch_error.zip)\n- top left menu: Project > Find in Files...\n- type: x\nit finds 1 match\n- above the match, click the plus + button: create a new search tab\n- click on the first tab\n\n### Issue\n>  ERROR: scene/gui/tree.cpp:367 - Index p_column = 1 is out of bounds (cells.size() = 1).\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c86150f-f51b-45b7-b2f1-f69ffd8287a4\n\nThe number of times the error is printed seems to be based on the number of matches on the selected tab.\nnew_script.gd only has one line: extends Node\n'x' has one match, one error\n'n' has two matches, two errors\n'e' has three matches, three errors\n\n### Notes\n\nThere's no error in:\nv4.8.dev3.official [51105ccbe]\nv4.7.2.stable.official [ed1daf0bf]\n\nTabs are added differently in these versions:\nThe bottom panel is called: Search results\nThe panel has a top right toggle: Keep Results\nToggling it on and starting a new search: Project > Find in Files...\nAdds a new tab.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/57699f20-8a5d-4408-ae4d-82177c38d333\n \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[find_in_files_tab_switch_error.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31860435/find_in_files_tab_switch_error.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123220/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123220/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}